    <h2 class="govuk-heading-m">What happens next</h2>

    <p class="govuk-body">Your application will now be subject to a 28 day consultation period. The consultation period starts on the next working day after we received your full application.</p>

    <p class="govuk-body">Remember to display the Public Notice we send you at your proposed trading location for the full 28 days, and until we have made a decision on your application.</p>

    <p class="govuk-body">We will email you when there are updates on your application. You can also view the latest status of your application on your <a href="/dashboard" class="govuk-link">Licensing Dashboard</a>.</p>

